cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these measurements, please cite them as below."
title: "Speaker measurements: JBL Go 2 frequency response, distortion and output limits"
abstract: >-
  Swept-sine measurements of a JBL Go 2 Bluetooth speaker at six input levels,
  made with Room EQ Wizard. Includes raw .mdat files, exported data, figures and
  the scripts that produce them. The microphone and the SPL scale are not
  calibrated; relative results are reliable, absolute levels are not.
